{"id":1031102,"name":"赛托·审查Ⅱ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"赛托·审查Ⅱ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1031102]}],"trial":{"trial_id":31102,"stage":"阶段2","unlock_time":"2025-12-12 14:00:00","diary1":"赛托的身份被定义为“挟持人质强闯狄斯意图不轨的戾刃嫌犯”，对城防安全极端过敏的狄斯高层迫切想要从她口中逼问出一个符合他们预设的阴谋论答案。\n　　高层的强硬施压，赛托的不合作态度，双重压力让你左右为难。但你始终相信，你要做的归根结底只有一件事：取得信任，挖掘真相。","diary2":"你努力想要在双重压力中取得平衡，让赛托能够信任你，给出足以支持你说服狄斯高层，证明她和他们设想的阴谋并无关系的信息。这并不容易。\n　　审查中赛托表现出了不自然的防御性和抗拒性，完全拒绝配合，但你不会就此放弃。你知道她并不是她想塑造出的那个，只会破坏不懂守护的形象。","evidence":[{"ID":260823,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260824,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":131102001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":1,"dialogue_id":131102002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":131102023,"next":null